"hint": "Spilled variance per dept, then MATCH.",
"answer": "=INDEX(H2:H9,MATCH(MAX(SUMIF(B2:B97,H2:H9,E2:E97)-SUMIF(B2:B97,H2:H9,D2:D97)),SUMIF(B2:B97,H2:H9,E2:E97)-SUMIF(B2:B97,H2:H9,D2:D97),0))"
},
{
"id": "fin-m-10",
"tier": "medium",
"topic": "INDEX/MATCH",
"title": "Owner of the most over-budget dept",
