"hint": "Wrap the previous answer in XLOOKUP.",
"answer": "=XLOOKUP(INDEX(H2:H9,MATCH(MAX(SUMIF(B2:B97,H2:H9,E2:E97)-SUMIF(B2:B97,H2:H9,D2:D97)),SUMIF(B2:B97,H2:H9,E2:E97)-SUMIF(B2:B97,H2:H9,D2:D97),0)),H2:H9,I2:I9)"
},
{
